almost $460 million of revenue.

00:12:01.679 --> 00:12:06.475
And in 2023, we'll do
$1.7 billion of revenue.

00:12:06.475 --> 00:12:09.103
Chamath always tweets a one-page thesis

00:12:09.103 --> 00:12:11.689
